Z||000007||Carrolles||03-16-2001||12:50 PM||||Wide open gap on your plugs will limit top end.  When I got my 85SE v-6 it lacked top end power.  I pulled the plugs and they were all in excess of .090" gap.  New plugs with proper gap really livened up the higher rpms.<P>Also look for a cat that is getting clogged up.  The restriction in the exhaust will limit rpms.||||reg||1
Z||000008||b lo 0||03-17-2001||01:23 PM||||Carroles, thnx for the info.  I'll check it out.  My cat is brand new, maybe 8 months old.  The plugs may be it, tho.  I didn't even think of the plugs!||||reg||1
